sequenceDiagram
autonumber

actor User as User
participant Frontend as "teste.localhost.test:5173\nReact frontend"
participant Api as "api.localhost.test:3001\nNest API"
participant Google as Google OAuth
participant Db as Postgres

User->>Frontend: Open /club/login
Frontend->>Api: GET /v1/auth/me with credentials
Api->>Db: Validate identity_sessions token, tenant scoped

alt No valid tenant session
Api-->>Frontend: 401 Unauthorized

User->>Frontend: Click Entrar com Google
Frontend-->>User: Navigate to /v1/auth/google?tenant=teste&returnTo=/club

User->>Api: GET /v1/auth/google?tenant=teste&returnTo=/club
Api->>Db: Load active tenant by slug teste
Api->>Api: Create signed OAuth state with tenantId, tenantSlug, returnTo

Api-->>User: 302 redirect to Google with central callback URL
User->>Google: Authenticate and consent

Google-->>User: 302 redirect to /v1/auth/google/callback?code=...&state=...

User->>Api: GET /v1/auth/google/callback
Api->>Api: Validate signed state and internal returnTo

Api->>Db: Upsert Google user by googleSubject
Api->>Db: Require active tenant membership
Api->>Db: Create identity_sessions row scoped to tenant

Api-->>User: Set HttpOnly cookie Domain=.localhost.test
Api-->>User: Redirect to tenant

User->>Frontend: GET http://teste.localhost.test:5173/club

Frontend->>Api: GET /v1/auth/me with credentials
Api->>Db: Validate session belongs to tenant teste

Api-->>Frontend: 200 tenant principal

else Valid tenant session
Api-->>Frontend: 200 tenant principal
Frontend-->>User: Redirect to /club
end
